{"id":"wb-5-286","name":"耦园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"耦园","text":"耦园，苏式古典园林，处于平江古城保护区的腹地，座北朝南，三面环水，面积为0.8公顷。耦园包括东花园、西花园和中部住宅三个部分，其中尤以东花园之景色最胜。\n2000年，增补为世界文化遗产——苏州古典园林项目。2001年，列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%80%A6%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":86681863,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86681863","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d55df7e52a8b30d38a1c8a9e.jpg","title":"Couple_retreat_garden.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Couple_retreat_garden.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f8/Couple_retreat_garden.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Original uploader was MYSHEROS at zh.wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​江蘇省蘇州市耦園。","width":320,"height":240}}